  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Don't touch the buttons. Good idea. Who knows what they do, right? Oh, you know? How wou- You know what, I'm just going to shut up and watch.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-SKY-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This must be quite a shock to the Bantam. This room redefines his entire world. Redefines his very existence. I can sympathize.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_LinNoHat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-URSAI_041.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524717,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-SKY-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Nevertheless, he does raise a valid point. You do remember how to... synthesize... the Attunement Stone, right? It's got to be one of these buttons.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_LinNoHat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-URSAI_042.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524717,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Congratulations, Hero. You've discovered the secret of the Angry Mountain. The Eruption Simulations will be permanently ceased.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-URSAI_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When I plucked the Lemurs from the Spiral and brought them to my new world, I intended them to be the glue that binds Lemurian society.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-URSAI_011.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Ursai was an experiment to see how Bearfolk would react to a life in which they had but one environmental threat to account for: the volcano.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-URSAI_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Lemurs were tasked with guiding the Bearfolk, with the ultimate goal of having someone, a Hero, conquer the volcano's eruptions.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-URSAI_013.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The pageantry they invented around the volcano was unexpected... yet illuminating. Thankfully, you were able to parse the true intention.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-URSAI_014.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You are clearly of an advanced ilk, but you have much to prove yet. Claim the next Stone. Your quest will materialize from there.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-URSAI_015.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-URSAI-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So what's your plan for that Stone? Open the darkest secret of the Old One? I'm in! But we should probably update the Ursai villagers first...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Chicken_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Bantam_LM-URSAI_036.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520127,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
